Assesses basic data modeling (Codable), local persistence (Documents directory), SwiftUI state management, and a practical export UX via UIActivityViewController.

## Key Concepts
- Codable models for Habit and DayLog
- File I/O in the app sandbox (Documents directory)
- SwiftUI list rendering with @Published/Combine
